WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:05.800
Lucifans can rejoice as everyone's favourite
devilish detective duo is back in the City

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.130
of Angels, and this time they've got demonic
prophecies and apple-loving ladies to deal

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.130
with.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.800
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, I'm Jan and today
we're delving into the season 4 finale of

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.010
Lucifer on Netflix, how the ending relates
back to previous seasons, and what it all

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.529
means for the future of the show.

00:00:20.529 --> 00:00:24.839
We will, of course, be talking spoilers, so
take care if you're not all caught up.

00:00:24.839 --> 00:00:29.890
When Team Lucifer foil Father Kinley's end-of-the-world
prophecy and banish Dromos and his fellow

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:35.190
invading demons back to Hell in the season
4 finale, Chloe thinks it's over, but Lucifer

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:39.090
explains that now the demons know he doesn't
want to go back to the Underworld, they'll

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:43.760
eventually return to Earth, maybe putting
baby Charlie or Chloe in danger.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.620
Luci breaks the news that he has to go and
be their king to contain them.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:51.570
It's a bittersweet moment for Deckerstar fans
because Chloe then reveals that she loves

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:55.071
Lucifer and he confesses back to her:
"My first love was never Eve.

00:00:55.071 --> 00:00:56.859
It was you, Chloe.

00:00:56.859 --> 00:00:59.269
It always has been."

00:00:59.269 --> 00:01:03.730
This is a huge moment for both characters,
especially Lucifer who not only sacrifices

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.910
the life he's built for himself in LA, but
also the chance to be with the person he truly

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:11.230
loves and who's grown to accept him for everything
he is.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:15.900
In a selfless act, Lucifer gives it all up
and returns to Hell and, as he does, his white

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.270
feather angel wings return.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:22.710
Lucifer had these last in the season 3 finale
when he used them to protect Chloe, but until

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:27.250
that moment in season 4, we've only seen him
with his much more devilish bat wings.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.640
So, the return of Luci's angel wings show
that he's finally overcome his self-hatred

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:36.060
and angst over whether Chloe can accept him
for who he is and he's also finally come to

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:39.580
accept himself and stop battling his feelings
for the Detective.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:43.540
And there's an interesting detail in this
scene which circles back to the penultimate

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.780
episode of season 3.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.560
"Chloe, I am the devil.

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.140
No you're not.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:52.730
Not to me."

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:57.320
In that scene, like this one, Lucifer also
called the detective by her real name "Chloe"

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:59.020
just before she kissed him.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:03.640
Back then, obviously, Chloe thought Lucifer
was just referring to himself as the devil

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.090
metaphorically.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:10.090
But after she discovered at the end of season
3 that Lucifer was quite literally the devil,

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.130
season 4 has been all about her coming to
terms with this knowledge.

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:18.120
Chloe's struggle to fully accept Lucifer's
demonic side causes her to fall out with Luci,

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:22.750
which sets up the introduction of Eve, someone
who already accepts Lucifer for who he is

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.630
and someone who's also similar to him as she
abandoned heaven because she was bored up

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:30.890
there in much the same way that Luci was bored
of Hell when he moved to LA.

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:35.819
Eve is madly in love with Luci, but her obsession
ends up being unhealthy for both of them.

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:40.230
When she encourages Lucifer to return to his
devilish, punishing ways, the difference between

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:44.380
her influence on him and Chloe's is summed
up perfectly in this scene where the three

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:46.560
of them go to confront Tiernan:
"Lucifer.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:49.270
He will be punished.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.560
Lucifer.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.150
Lucifer, stop.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.030
Lucifer, do it."

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:01.610
Eve is deliberately shown here as a devil-like
figure on Lucifer's shoulder goading him to

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:06.270
lean into his darker side while Chloe is the
opposite, an angel-like figure on his other

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:09.080
shoulder, reminding him that those things
are wrong.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:13.080
Eve's portrayal during much of the season
is something of a reversal of her traditional

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.540
biblical story where she was tempted by a
serpent to take fruit from the Tree of Knowledge.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.830
In the show, when Eve returns to Earth, she's
the one tempting the devil, whereas back in

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.370
the Garden of Eden, it was Luci doing the
tempting.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.830
"Maybe you've read about it in a little book
called The Bible.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.000
You know, the garden, the snake, the apple.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.490
The metaphors were a bit off.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:31.490
That's true.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:34.940
The forbidden fruit was less of an apple and
more like a banana."

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:38.849
Because she was so wildly in love with Lucifer,
it seemed like she was going to be what set

00:03:38.849 --> 00:03:43.470
Kinley's prophecy in motion and she did but
in a different way than perhaps expected as

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:47.750
she killed Kinley, sending a message to a
demon from Hell to come back in his body so

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.360
she and Lucifer could be together.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:54.239
But eventually, by the end of the season,
Eve realises that she needs to truly discover

00:03:54.239 --> 00:03:55.640
who she really is.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:00.580
"I've realized the way I've been acting with
Lucifer is the exact same way I've acted with

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.580
Adam.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:07.050
You know, I keep... trying to change myself
to... be this person I think they want me

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.050
to be.

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.380
I would never ask you to change, Eve.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.730
I like who you are.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:17.889
I don't even know who that is yet.

00:04:17.889 --> 00:04:19.389
I need to figure that out.

00:04:19.389 --> 00:04:20.389
I'm going to need to do that on my own."

00:04:20.389 --> 00:04:24.370
It'll be interesting to see if Eve is brought
back into the show in a future season.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:28.319
She admitted to Maze they had a connection
before she left, so they may still get together

00:04:28.319 --> 00:04:29.520
in the future.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:33.680
In the meantime, Kinley did mention to Eve
that she could be the Queen of Hell by Lucifer's

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:38.039
side and I wonder if there's a slight chance
that she might end up visiting him there,

00:04:38.039 --> 00:04:39.830
even taking his place.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:43.810
She did seem to love punishing evil-doers
on Earth so being in charge of that in Hell

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:49.059
could be a good fit, though perhaps she was
just doing that as she thought it was what

00:04:49.059 --> 00:04:50.059
Luci wanted.

00:04:50.059 --> 00:04:53.009
Ok, what other ways could Lucifer get out
of Hell in Season 5?

00:04:53.009 --> 00:04:56.580
For a clue, let's revisit what happened at
the end of the first season.

00:04:56.580 --> 00:05:00.580
In that season finale, Lucifer was killed
and went to Hell although it was only temporary

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.490
as he made a deal with his father, God.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:07.020
An exact replay of that wouldn't be possible
this time as Lucifer needs a substitute ruler

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.889
to govern Hell in his place.

00:05:08.889 --> 00:05:13.270
One possibility might be that Luci asks God
to send a different angel to keep control

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.050
over the Underworld.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:18.419
Lucifer and Amenadiel have several siblings,
some of whom we've already met.

00:05:18.419 --> 00:05:22.509
There's Remy who appeared this season when
she tried to take Amenadiel's baby back to

00:05:22.509 --> 00:05:23.889
the Silver City.

00:05:23.889 --> 00:05:28.710
And there's Azrael, aka the Angel of Death,
who was introduced in the Season 3 bonus episode

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.819
"Boo Normal".

00:05:29.819 --> 00:05:33.999
In that episode, Azrael revealed that Lucifer
was one of her favourite brothers and that

00:05:33.999 --> 00:05:38.210
she'd always meant to visit him in Hell after
his rebellion against God, and I wonder if

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.710
this time she'll make good on that and come
to see him in Season 5.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:46.979
An alternative new character who could resolve
Lucifer's dilemma of being stuck in Hell is

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:48.499
Lilith, Adam's first wife.

00:05:48.499 --> 00:05:52.360
She was namechecked a couple of times this
season, first by Eve:

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:56.460
"Lilith tamed the beasts of the night.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.689
Stupid, perfect Lilith."

00:05:58.689 --> 00:06:01.900
And then by Maze
"My mother, Lilith...

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:04.669
Let's just say she wasn't mom of the year."

00:06:04.669 --> 00:06:09.069
Now, what's interesting is that Eve said that
"Lilith tamed the beasts of the night" suggesting

00:06:09.069 --> 00:06:13.319
that if she were introduced to the show, she
could be a fearsome ruler who could keep Hell's

00:06:13.319 --> 00:06:14.669
demons in check.

00:06:14.669 --> 00:06:19.169
By the way, if you're a fan of Chilling Adventures
of Sabrina, this will make sense to you.

00:06:19.169 --> 00:06:22.759
Something that could be an intriguing twist
is that rather than Lucifer going back to

00:06:22.759 --> 00:06:25.840
LA, Chloe could instead become his queen in
Hell!

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.879
This isn't something I can see working easily
with all the other supporting characters who

00:06:29.879 --> 00:06:30.879
would still be in LA.

00:06:30.879 --> 00:06:34.270
So if it did happen, I could only see this
happening briefly until there was some other

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:35.740
resolution.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:40.900
And talking of supporting characters, many
of them also went through crises like Lucifer,

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.020
Chloe and Eve this season.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:46.949
Maze discovered she was becoming too dependent
on looking after Linda and her unborn child

00:06:46.949 --> 00:06:50.039
after Linda told her she needed to find her
own partner.

00:06:50.039 --> 00:06:54.479
Maze did make that connection with Eve, although
it wasn't reciprocated entirely, in a similar

00:06:54.479 --> 00:06:56.960
way to how Lucifer was with about Eve.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:01.909
So perhaps next season, we'll see Maze exploring
other potential partnerships as well as continuing

00:07:01.909 --> 00:07:03.449
to kick ass.

00:07:03.449 --> 00:07:08.289
The show's cast are all absolutely wonderful,
and Aimee Garcia is just perfect as Ella.

00:07:08.289 --> 00:07:12.599
This season, Ella suffered a crisis of faith
after the death of Charlotte with both her

00:07:12.599 --> 00:07:15.120
attitude and her T-shirts turning a little
darker.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.220
And Ella and Dan also shared a brief intimate
moment which surprised me because it seemed

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:20.339
to come out of nowhere.

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:24.279
However, looking back over the season, it
seems they connected over their similar feelings

00:07:24.279 --> 00:07:25.279
about the loss of Charlotte.

00:07:25.279 --> 00:07:26.889
"Hope you know that I'm here for you.

00:07:26.889 --> 00:07:27.940
You're not alone.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.840
See, that's just it.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.689
I never used to feel alone.

00:07:32.689 --> 00:07:34.909
Because I always had the big guy.

00:07:34.909 --> 00:07:36.599
I really miss him.

00:07:36.599 --> 00:07:38.699
I was just so mad.

00:07:38.699 --> 00:07:39.889
So mad after Charlotte.

00:07:39.889 --> 00:07:41.149
I've been mad too."

00:07:41.149 --> 00:07:46.169
But, by the end of the season, Ella puts her
crucifix back on and Dan understands the foolishness

00:07:46.169 --> 00:07:48.129
of going back to his old shady ways.

00:07:48.129 --> 00:07:52.639
As for Trixie, well, it was nice to see her
make up with Maze, but I wish we'd seen a

00:07:52.639 --> 00:07:56.719
lot more of her as she's such a good actress
and her on-screen chemistry is so great with

00:07:56.719 --> 00:07:58.249
all the adult actors.

00:07:58.249 --> 00:08:00.270
"Where do you live?

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.270
Here.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:02.800
Where are you from?

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:03.800
Far away.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:04.800
I came here for Lucifer.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.479
Keep the commentary to yourself, lady."

00:08:06.479 --> 00:08:09.849
However, I think she may be a casualty of
having a shorter season now.

00:08:09.849 --> 00:08:12.499
Fingers crossed, we see more of her next time.

00:08:12.499 --> 00:08:16.469
By the way, if you're curious about what Maze
really said when she spoke Lilim to Linda,

00:08:16.469 --> 00:08:19.409
tap at the top of the screen to check out
my other Lucifer video.

00:08:19.409 --> 00:08:24.300
So, how do you feel about the ending to season
4 and do you have any predictions or things

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.249
you'd like to see in Season 5?

00:08:26.249 --> 00:08:28.360
Leave your thoughts in the comments below.

